---
import Frame from './Frame.astro';
---
<Frame active="Coworker Gallery">
	<div class="con-head"><div><h4>Coworker Gallery</h4><p>What your people are offered, and the queue of what they submitted. Nothing is published without a person.</p></div></div>
	<div class="gal">
		<div class="gal-queue">
			<h5>Review queue · 1</h5>
			<div class="gal-item">
				<div class="gal-t"><strong>Incident Scribe</strong> <span class="mono">v3 · submitted by dana · 2h ago</span></div>
				<p>Keeps the record of a live incident so the postmortem starts from evidence. Connectors: Slack, Jira, GitHub.</p>
				<div class="gal-scan"><span class="pill ok">scan: 0 critical</span><span class="pill warn">1 note · skill "timeline" fetches a URL</span><span class="pill neutral">manifest + 2 skills shown in full below</span></div>
				<div class="btns"><span class="btn sm primary">Approve and sign</span><span class="btn sm ghost">Reject with a note</span></div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<aside class="gal-side">
			<h5>Serving this organisation · 9</h5>
			<ul><li>Security</li><li>Dependency Audit</li><li>Cloud Posture</li><li>AppSec Reviewer</li><li>Data Analyst</li><li>Design Reviewer</li><li>Onboarding Guide</li><li>Wiz Security Analyst</li><li>Incident Scribe <span class="faint">v2</span></li></ul>
			<h5>Updates</h5>
			<p><span class="pill warn">Hold on</span> Release 0.2.4 is held for this fleet. Machines stay on 0.2.3 until you release it. On the policy chain.</p>
		</aside>
	</div>
</Frame>
